# Applied to the tephra build context (BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore`).
# Keep the context small: only the Cargo workspace sources are needed to build the server.
# Keep benches/ and tests/ — the workspace manifest declares [[bench]] targets, so Cargo
# needs those files present to parse it, even though we only build the server binary.
target/
.git/
.devenv/
.direnv/
.claude/
*.md
